{"items":{"1221114":{"biography":"Yuichi Nakamura è un doppiatore giapponese. Precedentemente affiliato a Sigma Seven e attualmente a Intention. Ha doppiato Gray Fullbuster in Fairy Tail, Gai Tsutsugami in Guilty Crown, Tatsuya Shiba in The Irregular at Magic High School, Karamatsu in Osomatsu-san, Alto Saotome in Macross Frontier, Tomoya Okazaki in Clannad, Kyōsuke Kōsaka in Oreimo, Hotaro Oreki in Hyouka e Bruno Bucciarati in JoJo's Bizarre Adventure: Vento Aureo  Nei videogiochi ha doppiato Hazama e Yūki Terumi in BlazBlue, Sakon Shima in Sengoku Basara 4, Cid Raines in Final Fantasy XIII e Fei Long in Street Fighter IV.","birthday":"1980-02-20","checked_at":"2026-11-26","deathday":"","filmography":[{"character":"Keizo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/bq88RHSdnT2rpt4ki9CJUxHz2gH.jpg","title":"Demon Slayer: Il Castello dell'Infinito - Parte 1","tmdb_id":1311031,"type":"movie","year":2025},{"character":"Satoru Gojo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/e2EWGvtko8mQD7HPA99KHysNQNN.jpg","title":"JUJUTSU KAISEN: Esecuzione","tmdb_id":1539104,"type":"movie","year":2025},{"character":"Tetsuro Kuroo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gMkHkJ1DZ8UhRLQU7176rU1kKhA.jpg","title":"HAIKYU!! Battaglia all'ultimo Rifiuto","tmdb_id":1012201,"type":"movie","year":2024},{"character":"Satoru Gojo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zKFkzRn1UyE11Jv9CJjVmvmQFvR.jpg","title":"Jujutsu Kaisen","tmdb_id":95479,"type":"tv","year":2020},{"character":"Reinhard van Astrea (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2FvWqbgJDG2IWGgUxhROYQxE98p.jpg","title":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-","tmdb_id":65942,"type":"tv","year":2016},{"character":"Renji Yomo (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5XBk7T4NsGeN9RG39y2nU6gRWQl.jpg","title":"Tokyo Ghoul","tmdb_id":61374,"type":"tv","year":2014},{"character":"Bruno Bucciarati (voice)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/saqAUkE10gq9HYczLy5P4EDETfR.jpg","title